WEBVTT

00:11:59.256 --> 00:12:01.216
was always going to fall short.

00:12:03.218 --> 00:12:05.804
The full potential of the brain
would then be unlocked.

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:10.267
But for right now,

00:12:10.267 --> 00:12:15.439
BCI is about restoring the lives
of millions of people with paralysis.

00:12:15.439 --> 00:12:18.150
After years of feeling trapped,

00:12:18.192 --> 00:12:22.988
this technology promises the return
of autonomy and independence.

00:12:23.781 --> 00:12:26.617
But what I really mean is dignity.

00:12:27.576 --> 00:12:28.744
Thank you.

00:12:28.786 --> 00:12:35.417
(Applause)